  "description": "Childhood tragedy turned Lee Ju-Hyeok into an angry, omega-hating alpha. He has enemies, his partners can’t pleasure him, and he can’t remember the one dearest to him. However, his right-hand man, Kwon I-Hyeon, knows who he once was and chooses to stay by his side. But after an incident results in the two eloping, Ju-Hyeok’s urge to have I-Hyeon all for himself begins to grow. His demands are getting worse, and it’s only a matter of time before there’s nothing left of I-Hyeon… not even a scent.\n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes one special chapter and six side story chapters.*",
